# SGAP architecture

Before adding game logic, read `docs/architecture/README.md`.

- New game = manifest + symbols + probe. Do not copy specs or controllers per title.
- No `if (gameId === '…')` in `src/controllers` or `tests/specs`.
- Button ratios, iframe selectors, and bet URL patterns belong in `config/manifests/<gameId>.json`.
- Vision bands and Phaser HUD boxes are still leaked in support/runtime code. Extend config; do not add another hardcoded Sugar coordinate.
- Pass/fail is an observable response (usually `/bet`), not a screenshot alone.
- Host page is the launcher. Game clicks happen inside the iframe.
